      "message": "ACK.\nIt\u0027s probably ok to assume the knowlege.\n\nLet\u0027s put it this way, one of your target audience for these userspace controller drivers should be people that were ready to make a kernel controller driver (including the prereq knowledge) but changed their mind in the last second to put it in userspace.",
